        },
        "textContent": "\n\t\t\tMosh'Ogg-Ringrichter\n\t\t\tMosh'ogg Enforcer\n\t\t\tDéspota Mosh'ogg\n\t\t\tAgente mosh'ogg\n\t\t\tMassacreur mosh’Ogg\n\t\t\tScagnozzo Mosh'ogg\n\t\t\tモッシュオグの審判\n\t\t\t모쉬오그 집행자\n\t\t\tMosz'ogg nadzorca\n\t\t\tImpositor Mosh'ogg\n\t\t\tАрбитр Мош'Огг\n\t\t\tผู้คุมกฎมอชอ็อก\n\t\t\t莫什奥格执行者\n\t\t\t莫什奧格執法者\n\t\t"
      },
      "184": {
        "present": true,
        "type": "LocString",
        "valueAttributePresent": false,
        "valueAttribute": null,
        "locales": {
          "deDE": {
            "present": true,
            "value": "<b>Spott</b>, <b>Gottesschild</b>"
          },
          "enUS": {
